<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Deep Hands-On Real Estate Perspective.</I></B> Starwood Capital has 26 years of experience covering every real estate asset class. The
