<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Design Leadership.</I></B> Starwood Capital believes that it possesses an expertise in the design of real estate assets that is
