<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Strong Risk-Adjusted Performance.</I></B> Starwood Capital&#146;s disciplined investment approach has enabled it to consistently deliver
