will directly benefit from the expertise of several members of Starwood Capital&#146;s senior team who will serve as our directors and executive officers and as members of the Advisor&#146;s Investment Committee, as applicable. </P>
<P STYLE="font-size:18pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
