dividends-paid deduction and excluding net capital gains. See &#147;Description of Capital Stock&#151;Distribution Policy&#148; and &#147;Material U.S. Federal Income Tax Considerations.&#148; </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:4%; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The per share amount of distributions on Class T, Class S, Class D and Class I shares will likely differ because of different allocations of
