Repurchases&#151;Repurchase Limitations.&#148; </P> <P STYLE="margin-top:18pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Economic events that may cause our stockholders to request that we repurchase their shares may
