<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman"><B><I>Brendan Brogan </I></B>has served as a member of the Advisor&#146;s Investment Committee since November&nbsp;2017. Mr.&nbsp;Brogan has served as
