calculating our monthly NAV, our properties initially will be valued at cost, which we expect to represent fair value at that time. We expect to receive an appraisal performed by a third party on each property prior to or upon acquisition. </P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Each property will then be valued by an independent third-party appraisal firm no less than annually. Properties purchased as a portfolio may be valued as a
