<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">During the period January 31, 2014 through January 5, 2016, Starwood Waypoint Homes disposed of approximately 1,073 properties. The aggregate net sales
