<P STYLE="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">The following is a summary of certain considerations associated with the purchase and holding of any class of our shares of common stock by employee benefit
plans that are subject to Title I of the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended (&#147;ERISA&#148;), plans, individual retirement accounts (&#147;IRAs&#148;) and other arrangements that are subject to Section&nbsp;4975 of the
